    {
        "text": "And right after 'Ga\u0142\u0105zka' comes 'Flametail'! Whoa, way-way-way, how many times has someone come for the Nascent Nearl now? You gotta get your own show, Maria!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "God, I hate that guy. You're too loud!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, we're running out of foes to fight. Looks like we finally get to size each other up, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014If all we're doing is measuring, I'll gladly keep you company.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ooh. Not bad. Your eyes got a lot better since you messed up Plastic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
