        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What did she do just now...? She wasn't that fast\u2014more like just too dexterous...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahh. I see how you held up for so long against Ingra and Szewczyk now... you've got a better foundation than I thought.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whislash taught you all of that, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
