        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the hell? Arts\u2014no, you can't be, you're not even armed!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Ga\u0142\u0105zka' Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, you... you... you can't be\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Ga\u0142\u0105zka' Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jeez, Louise...! What a good day to earn some free points... Alright, where were we, little Nearl?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Here she comes again\u2014!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "D'ja know? Fun fact, I'm Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Infecte\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$b_char_defboost",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "And another point. It is SO easy to distract you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "...But when you said Infected, you weren't just saying it, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "You used your Arts directly just now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't it a shame?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "When the Blood Knight took the title, they went 'yeah, we'll officially let Infected be knights'\u2014but when the Radiant Knight got infected, they chased her completely out of Kazimierz. Doesn't that suck?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Margaret...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your debut battle was at the Roar Arena, right? All you needed to do was take your paperwork to the Knights Association, sign for your tournament credentials, and then head backstage to gear up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know how much\u2014how MUCH\u2014an Infected has to do to get here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "They think it's funny to lock you in a cage of gloompincer first. They think it's funny to make you trample the blood of other Infected, leaving one footprint at a time... they make you win back your humanity, to prove you're a normal, living, breathing person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Welcome to the bottom line. They weren't gonna give the Infected any respect for a single second. 'Just throw them into the machine. Make them one more symbol of our progress.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Don't you think I have the right to hate it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Our sights are set on every noble knight who thinks her opinion means the world... we'll go under their own rules, cut them right where it hurts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, I'm not here to knock you out of the game... after all, I respect the Radiant Knight from the bottom of my heart. Being Infected doesn't sway me there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's call the points I've already taken a fee, and here's a lesson on behalf of 'Whislash.' From the match where you beat Ingra, I can tell you still don't understand what the actual significance of the Major is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blind enthusiasm? Riding your own efforts, tuning all the warning signs out? In any ideal scenario, worst is you'd fall flat on your face. But this is the Major. That'll kill you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep it up. Whatever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$b_char_defboost",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "Light? Same thing as when you beat Ingra...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Hiyaah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you kidding?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's one point back, Flametail!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "Goddamn. Didn't think you were so stupid thirsty for it\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014But hey, now you look like the Radiant Knight's sister!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "We step back, put some distance between us. Our blades face off again."
    },
    {
        "text": "...This feels strange."
    },
    {
        "text": "We just talked a little, simple as that. Facing her, I can't feel any of the same immense, nauseating pressure Szewczyk and Ingra had... is it just because of her nature?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet she's so strong. Ngh. And fast. And masterful."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're smiling? You're that confident?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Am I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh. Give it a try and you'll find out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passing Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, then...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
