    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaaaaaand\u2014! Tiiiiiiiime!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "We stop in our tracks as soon as we hear the announcer."
    },
    {
        "text": "By just a hair\u2014by just the slightest hair, we could've been touching the other's armor."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lightly, like she's just messing with me, 'Flametail' taps against my shield."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe you'd have taken one more point off me here. Maybe not. Who can say, Maria?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Flametail' Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could've been two, maybe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahahaha\u2014you know, from the stands, it's hard to tell just how fiercely stubborn you are, Nearlie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Flametail' Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "And our refs are finished judging! At the end of this free-for-all, only four remained standing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yo, audience! Here's the deciding moment your wallets have been waiting for! Even if your favorite knight started out getting knocked around six ways from Sunday, don't you lose the light! The Arena's here to welcome you back any time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fourth place! Earning ten points, the arena was his to walk, and he avoided almost any direct battle! Our survivor with smarts, 'Ga\u0142\u0105zka' Daniel!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Third place! Hunted by the whole arena since the word go, and without a moment to breathe, she might be our biggest winner on the points exchange tonight! Our dainty, charming independent knight, Maria Nearl!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Second place! In the starting skirmishes, he beat three knights with his own hands! He made the arena's corner his own with his tremendous shields! The walking fortress, 'Limestone' Marko!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "And our champion tonight, with twenty-two fresh points to her name! A near uninterrupted combo of victories! The super-rookie who never drags her feet\u2014'Flametail' Sona!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that win of hers means a mean mountain of money, so let's make some mega noise\u2014! Coming up! We'll be announcing the lottery draws for each prize pool! Tonight, while the knights strike the sky, the audience strikes it big! All at the Fireblade Arena!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
