    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, welcome, dear Miss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Having the fortune to meet the youngest ever to join the Kazimierz Armorless Union, the mighty Platinum, I admit that I, humble Czarny, am profoundly terrified.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_204_platnm_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, can we not with the niceness, Spokesman, sir. You're the ones who yelled for me anyway, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_204_platnm_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hardly, hardly. I'm merely the General Chamber's mouthpiece, working as its directors will it. How could I dare think to command the mighty Platinum?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_204_platnm_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You say that, but, like, two of them are just busy and then the three above make everyone else do all the work forever, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, this sucks... I hate overtime. I already had enough work before you called me... Seriously, I wanna go on vacation to Sami once the Major's done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_204_platnm_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as the General Chamber agrees, I can arrange you a Sami countryside villa right this moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_204_platnm_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I gotta wait until work's over, thoughhh\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014What do you want the Armorless Union to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_204_platnm_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We have many problems on our hands, dear Miss. Infected out of line, curious rumors, knights drawing a little too much attention...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I trust that at the nod of the mighty Platinum of the Armorless Union, none of these will be a problem at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
