    },
    {
        "text": "A guest? Now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "They can wait until Maria's back\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... apologies, Zofia, for coming uninvited...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one who... *sigh*... I remember you had your own little company, and then you broke into my place like this, thinking you'd make off with all my sponsorship rights.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, out with it. What now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I, uh, there's some... I have some info here... probably some of it's rumors...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But don't tell anyone! True or false, the event plans here are all top, top secret...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But I think you've guessed that already... just treat this as me paying you back... and, uh, I hope things turn out well for you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_109#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I haven't seen a good knight in a long time... who had a happy ending.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corporate Employee"
    },
